OL,3,GNEWSAFed-up driver builds AI litter
OL,4,Atracker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA software developer became so
OL,7,Ffrustrated by the amount of rubbish he
OL,8,Fsaw dumped along roadsides that he
OL,9,Fbuilt an AI-powered "litter dashcam" to
OL,10,Fexpose the scale of the problem.
OL,12,FRobin Bennett, from Shrewsbury,
OL,13,Fdeveloped the Roadside Litter app after
OL,14,Fnoticing what he believed was a growing
OL,15,Famount of litter while driving around
OL,16,Fthe county.
OL,18,FThe technology has already logged more
OL,19,Fthan 3,000 litter reports in Shropshire
OL,20,Fand more than 28,000 across the UK.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
