OL,3,GNEWSAFed-up driver builds AI litter
OL,4,Atracker
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is now sharing the data with
OL,7,Fanti-litter campaign group Clean Up
OL,8,FBritain in the hope it will encourage
OL,9,Faction, while Shropshire Council said
OL,10,Fit was exploring ways to improve litter
OL,11,Fmanagement on some of the county's
OL,12,Fbusiest roads.
